    {
      "text": "Uzzah put forth his hand to the ark … for the oxen shook it, 2 Sam. 6:6. shaketh the earth out of her place, Job 9:6. voice of the Lord shaketh the wilderness, Ps. 29:8 (Mosiah 27:15; Alma 29:1; Hel. 5:42; 12:11). earth shook … at the presence of God, Ps. 68:8. when he ariseth to shake terribly the earth, Isa. 2:19 (2 Ne. 12:19). I will shake the heavens, Isa. 13:13 (Hag. 2:6; 2 Ne. 23:13). foundations of the earth do shake, Isa. 24:18. Shake thyself from the dust, Isa. 52:2. Shall not the isles shake at the sound of thy fall, Ezek. 26:15. all the men … shall shake at my presence, Ezek. 38:20. heavens and the earth shall shake, Joel 3:16. shake all nations, Hag. 2:7.",
